      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To detect labels or objects in a static image, I will use the Amazon Rekognition service, which is a concrete external provider. I will import the necessary modules from the AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) and include the provider-specific client class to make the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
